  "description": "As Lt. Det. Esh Voss follows the darkening trail into Mia's death, his fight with insomnia begins to take over. His ongoing problematic relationship with Intuitive Counselor Jonah Leif, is only complicating matters and unlocking even deeper, more painful secrets from his tragic past. Refusing to accept that his nightmare visions may be real, and not just fragments of a sleep disorder, Voss tightens his grip on the tenuous reality he subscribes to at the determent of his own safety and care for those he protects.",
